Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:04.35,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}佩古拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}5 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 斯瓦泰克 · 赛后采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:01.37,EN,,0,0,0,,I've said and maybe mentioned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:01.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,这话我以前可能也说过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.37,0:00:03.05,EN,,0,0,0,,before, but my coach and I have this thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.37,0:00:03.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,我和教练之间有个说法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.05,0:00:04.85,EN,,0,0,0,,where we say it's just practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.05,0:00:04.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,就说这只是训练
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:06.49,EN,,0,0,0,,And so we kind of I kind of tell myself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:06.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以比赛打到一半时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.53,EN,,0,0,0,,that in the middle of the match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也会这样告诉自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:08.73,EN,,0,0,0,,because at the end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:08.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为归根结底
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:10.53,EN,,0,0,0,,of the day like I'm working on things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:10.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直都在练一些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:11.81,EN,,0,0,0,,and I know how I need to play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:11.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,也知道自己该怎么打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:13.81,EN,,0,0,0,,and I practice that all the time in practice,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:13.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,平时训练里一直这么练
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:15.17,EN,,0,0,0,,but when I come out here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:15.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,真正来到赛场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:16.77,EN,,0,0,0,,it's the same thing and next week it's going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:16.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实也是同一回事 下周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:17.85,EN,,0,0,0,,to be the same thing and when I go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:17.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是同一回事 到亚洲赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:19.09,EN,,0,0,0,,to Asia it's going to be the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:19.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,也还是同一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:21.77,EN,,0,0,0,,Like every single week it's the same story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:21.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一周其实都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.73,EN,,0,0,0,,So I just told myself to kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:23.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我只告诉自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:26.01,EN,,0,0,0,,of be brave, and I—like—the only way I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:26.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,要勇敢一点 因为我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:28.05,EN,,0,0,0,,was going to win was if I play a certain way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,只有那样打才可能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:29.25,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果我退到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:30.81,EN,,0,0,0,,if I'm 10 ft behind the baseline
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:30.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,底线后十英尺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:31.85,EN,,0,0,0,,and letting her push me around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.81,0:00:31.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,任由她压着我打 我赢不了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:32.69,EN,,0,0,0,,Like yeah, sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:32.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 有时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:34.45,EN,,0,0,0,,if I have to dig out a point, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:34.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,为了救下一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:35.81,EN,,0,0,0,,like that one point I'll do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:35.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,比如刚才那一分 我会去拼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.81,0:00:39.09,EN,,0,0,0,,but I really have to impose taking away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.81,0:00:39.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,但整体上我必须打出压迫感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.09,0:00:40.61,EN,,0,0,0,,time away from her and I know we've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.09,0:00:40.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,抢走她的时间 这正是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:41.77,EN,,0,0,0,,been working on that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:41.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们一直在练的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:43.97,EN,,0,0,0,,So I just had to trust kind of just getting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:43.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我只能相信这些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:45.89,EN,,0,0,0,,my footwork a little bit sharper,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:45.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,让脚下移动再敏捷一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:47.77,EN,,0,0,0,,looking to take the ball early
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:47.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,争取更早击球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:49.33,EN,,0,0,0,,and doing what I know I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:49.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,做我知道自己能做到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.33,0:00:51.85,EN,,0,0,0,,can do and it just happened to work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.33,0:00:51.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,真正做出来 今天刚好奏效了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:53.05,EN,,0,0,0,,So you still have a quick turnaround
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:53.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,离决赛很近 恢复时间依然很短
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:54.77,EN,,0,0,0,,before the final and you've shared
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.05,0:00:54.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,你之前也跟我们分享过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.77,0:00:56.37,EN,,0,0,0,,with us what that looks like day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.77,0:00:56.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,决赛前一天通常
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:58.01,EN,,0,0,0,,before before you get ready for a final,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:58.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,会怎么准备
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:00:59.89,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm curious between the last one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:00:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我更想知道 从上一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:02.49,EN,,0,0,0,,and here you had that medical timeout
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:02.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,到今天 你经历了医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:03.61,EN,,0,0,0,,and we were hoping you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:03.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们当然都希望你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.61,0:01:04.77,EN,,0,0,0,,be completely healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.61,0:01:04.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经完全恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.77,0:01:06.21,EN,,0,0,0,,We weren't sure until you stepped out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.77,0:01:06.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,可在你上场前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:06.37,EN,,0,0,0,,there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们也无法确定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:07.57,EN,,0,0,0,,You obviously look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:07.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天你的状态显然很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:07.77,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:07.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.77,0:01:09.17,EN,,0,0,0,,What did that day and a half look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.77,0:01:09.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一天半你是怎么过的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:10.61,EN,,0,0,0,,Were you Did you have to do anything extra
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.17,0:01:10.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,为了确保身体没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:11.49,EN,,0,0,0,,to make sure you were healthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.61,0:01:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,有额外做什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.49,0:01:12.17,EN,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.49,0:01:12.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:12.89,EN,,0,0,0,,Zero. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,零 完全没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:14.13,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean I got like a little treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.89,0:01:14.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是做了点简单治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:15.21,EN,,0,0,0,,but I did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:15.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,但除此之外什么都没干
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:16.57,EN,,0,0,0,,Laid out by the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:16.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,躺在泳池边晒太阳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:17.29,EN,,0,0,0,,I have a pool
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:17.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,我家里有泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:18.01,EN,,0,0,0,,That's the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:18.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是秘诀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:18.61,EN,,0,0,0,,house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:18.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,就在家里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.41,EN,,0,0,0,,That's the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,这才是秘诀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:21.49,EN,,0,0,0,,And I just like got some vitamin D
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:21.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后就晒晒太阳 补点维生素D
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:23.77,EN,,0,0,0,,and I literally did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:23.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.77,0:01:24.61,EN,,0,0,0,,No. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.77,0:01:24.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有 真的没有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:26.37,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't come to site at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:26.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,我完全没来比赛场地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:27.53,EN,,0,0,0,,I've done that like a few times here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.37,0:01:27.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,我以前也有几次这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.53,0:01:29.69,EN,,0,0,0,,and there—maybe Miami—when I'm really
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.53,0:01:29.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时确实会这样 比如迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.09,EN,,0,0,0,,when I was coming off playing a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,那次我之前已经打了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:33.57,EN,,0,0,0,,of really, like, long day matches,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,又漫长又辛苦的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:35.05,EN,,0,0,0,,I just won't come to site.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:35.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就干脆不来场地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:36.57,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my coaches love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:36.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,对 我的教练特别喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:37.45,EN,,0,0,0,,when I cuz I'm like kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我在训练上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:39.57,EN,,0,0,0,,of a practice like perfectionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:39.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,有点完美主义
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.57,0:01:42.45,EN,,0,0,0,,So they just love it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.57,0:01:42.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以对他们来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.45,0:01:44.77,EN,,0,0,0,,when I'm totally not motivated
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.45,0:01:44.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们就喜欢看到我完全
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.45,EN,,0,0,0,,to go to the site,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,不想来场地训练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.45,0:01:47.85,EN,,0,0,0,,they're really happy because they know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.45,0:01:47.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们反而高兴 因为知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:49.81,EN,,0,0,0,,that I'm in like a good place mentally
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:49.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的心理状态很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:51.69,EN,,0,0,0,,where I don't feel like I have to overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:51.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,不会觉得自己非得练过头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:53.37,EN,,0,0,0,,I think coming off of Amanda's match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:53.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想打完和阿曼达的那场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:54.69,EN,,0,0,0,,with a little bit of an injury
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:54.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,身上又有点伤
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.69,0:01:55.73,EN,,0,0,0,,that I wasn't sure how I was going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.69,0:01:55.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.73,0:01:58.57,EN,,0,0,0,,to recover, forced me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.73,0:01:58.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,不知能否恢复 反而逼我休息
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:01.25,EN,,0,0,0,,So, they were kind of happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以他们还挺开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:04.35,EN,,0,0,0,,She's got a sunshine glow about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:04.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,她整个人都晒出了阳光感
